# 📦 Dependencies (Prevents committing massive packages)
**/node_modules/

# 🔐 Environment Variables & Secrets (CRITICAL)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.production
**/.env.development

# 🚀 Production Build Outputs
**/dist/
**/build/
**/dist-ssr/
**/*.local

# 📋 Logs
**/logs/
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*

# 🛠️ Editor Directories & OS Junk
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?